-%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
-% BibTeX `apalike' bibliography style (24-Jan-88 version)
-% Adapted from the `alpha' style, version 0.99a; for BibTeX version 0.99a.
